#   brahmajala-sutta

[chant:0163 brahmajala-sutta]
[00:59.64]1 Evaṁ me sutaṁ— ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā antarā ca rājagahaṁ antarā ca nāḷandaṁ addhānamaggappaṭipanno hoti
[01:22.89]2 mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi.
[01:35.55]3 Suppiyopi kho paribbājako antarā ca rājagahaṁ antarā ca nāḷandaṁ
[01:49.08]4 addhānamaggappaṭipanno hoti saddhiṁ antevāsinā brahmadattena māṇavena.
[02:06.65]5 Tatra sudaṁ suppiyo paribbājako
[02:13.66]6 anekapariyāyena buddhassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsati,
[02:22.33]7 dhammassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsati,
[02:27.97]8 saṅghassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsati;
[02:34.01]9 suppiyassa pana paribbājakassa antevāsī brahmadatto māṇavo
[02:46.31]10 anekapariyāyena buddhassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsati,
[02:54.81]11 dhammassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsati,
[03:00.19]12 saṅghassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsati.
[03:05.79]13 Itiha te ubho ācariyantevāsī aññamaññassa ujuvipaccanīkavādā
[03:19.12]14 bhagavantaṁ piṭṭhito piṭṭhito anubandhā honti bhikkhusaṅghañca.
[03:30.60]15 Atha kho bhagavā ambalaṭṭhikāyaṁ rājāgārake ekarattivāsaṁ upagacchi
[03:44.36]16 saddhiṁ bhikkhusaṅghena.
[03:49.36]17 Suppiyopi kho paribbājako ambalaṭṭhikāyaṁ rājāgārake
[04:00.80]18 ekarattivāsaṁ upagacchi antevāsinā brahmadattena māṇavena.
[04:14.54]19 Tatrapi sudaṁ suppiyo paribbājako
[04:21.47]20 anekapariyāyena buddhassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsati,
[04:30.00]21 dhammassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsati,
[04:35.46]22 saṅghassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsati;
[04:41.07]23 suppiyassa pana paribbājakassa antevāsī brahmadatto māṇavo
[04:53.12]24 anekapariyāyena buddhassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsati,
[05:01.36]25 dhammassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsati, saṅghassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsati.
[05:10.42]26 Itiha te ubho ācariyantevāsī aññamaññassa ujuvipaccanīkavādā viharanti.
[05:25.12]27 Atha kho sambahulānaṁ bhikkhūnaṁ rattiyā paccūsasamayaṁ paccuṭṭhitānaṁ
[05:37.54]28 maṇḍalamāḷe sannisinnānaṁ sannipatitānaṁ
[05:46.12]29 ayaṁ saṅkhiyadhammo udapādi:
[05:52.55]30 “acchariyaṁ, āvuso, abbhutaṁ, āvuso,
[06:00.06]31 yāvañcidaṁ tena bhagavatā jānatā passatā arahatā sammāsambuddhena
[06:13.06]32 sattānaṁ nānādhimuttikatā suppaṭividitā.
[06:21.60]33 Ayañhi suppiyo paribbājako anekapariyāyena buddhassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsati,
[06:34.60]34 dhammassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsati, saṅghassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsati;
[06:44.31]35 suppiyassa pana paribbājakassa antevāsī brahmadatto māṇavo
[06:55.93]36 anekapariyāyena buddhassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsati,
[07:04.03]37 dhammassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsati, saṅghassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsati.
[07:13.04]38 Itihame ubho ācariyantevāsī aññamaññassa ujuvipaccanīkavādā
[07:25.66]39 bhagavantaṁ piṭṭhito piṭṭhito anubandhā honti bhikkhusaṅghañcā”ti.
[07:37.13]40 Atha kho bhagavā tesaṁ bhikkhūnaṁ imaṁ saṅkhiyadhammaṁ viditvā
[07:47.92]41 yena maṇḍalamāḷo tenupasaṅkami;
[07:54.77]42 upasaṅkamitvā paññatte āsane nisīdi.
[08:02.68]43 Nisajja kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi:
[08:10.45]44 “kāya nuttha, bhikkhave, etarahi kathāya sannisinnā sannipatitā,
[08:21.25]45 kā ca pana vo antarākathā vippakatā”ti?
[08:28.90]46 Evaṁ vutte, te bhikkhū bhagavantaṁ etadavocuṁ:
[08:37.81]47 “idha, bhante, amhākaṁ rattiyā paccūsasamayaṁ paccuṭṭhitānaṁ
[08:48.35]48 maṇḍalamāḷe sannisinnānaṁ sannipatitānaṁ
[08:56.72]49 ayaṁ saṅkhiyadhammo udapādi:
[09:03.02]50 ‘acchariyaṁ, āvuso, abbhutaṁ, āvuso,
[09:10.19]51 yāvañcidaṁ tena bhagavatā jānatā passatā arahatā sammāsambuddhena
[09:23.02]52 sattānaṁ nānādhimuttikatā suppaṭividitā.
[09:31.26]53 Ayañhi suppiyo paribbājako anekapariyāyena buddhassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsati,
[09:43.93]54 dhammassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsati, saṅghassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsati;
[09:53.22]55 suppiyassa pana paribbājakassa antevāsī brahmadatto māṇavo
[10:04.75]56 anekapariyāyena buddhassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsati,
[10:12.75]57 dhammassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsati, saṅghassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsati.
[10:21.60]58 Itihame ubho ācariyantevāsī aññamaññassa ujuvipaccanīkavādā
[10:34.05]59 bhagavantaṁ piṭṭhito piṭṭhito anubandhā honti bhikkhusaṅghañcā’ti.
[10:45.12]60 Ayaṁ kho no, bhante, antarākathā vippakatā,
[10:53.11]61 atha bhagavā anuppatto”ti.
[10:58.70]62 “Mamaṁ vā, bhikkhave, pare avaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[11:06.50]63 dhammassa vā avaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ, saṅghassa vā avaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[11:17.82]64 tatra tumhehi na āghāto na appaccayo na cetaso anabhiraddhi karaṇīyā.
[11:30.36]65 Mamaṁ vā, bhikkhave, pare avaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[11:38.34]66 dhammassa vā avaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ, saṅghassa vā avaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[11:50.03]67 tatra ce tumhe assatha kupitā vā anattamanā vā,
[11:58.24]68 tumhaṁ yevassa tena antarāyo.
[12:04.64]69 Mamaṁ vā, bhikkhave, pare avaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[12:12.37]70 dhammassa vā avaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ, saṅghassa vā avaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[12:23.52]71 tatra ce tumhe assatha kupitā vā anattamanā vā,
[12:31.77]72 api nu tumhe paresaṁ subhāsitaṁ dubbhāsitaṁ ājāneyyāthā”ti?
[12:43.03]73 “No hetaṁ, bhante”.
[12:47.47]74 “Mamaṁ vā, bhikkhave, pare avaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[12:55.26]75 dhammassa vā avaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ, saṅghassa vā avaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[13:06.53]76 tatra tumhehi abhūtaṁ abhūtato nibbeṭhetabbaṁ:
[13:15.45]77 ‘itipetaṁ abhūtaṁ, itipetaṁ atacchaṁ,
[13:22.57]78 natthi cetaṁ amhesu,
[13:27.40]79 na ca panetaṁ amhesu saṁvijjatī’ti.
[13:34.51]80 Mamaṁ vā, bhikkhave, pare vaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[13:41.93]81 dhammassa vā vaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ, saṅghassa vā vaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[13:52.78]82 tatra tumhehi na ānando na somanassaṁ
[14:00.12]83 na cetaso uppilāvitattaṁ karaṇīyaṁ.
[14:07.38]84 Mamaṁ vā, bhikkhave, pare vaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[14:14.78]85 dhammassa vā vaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ, saṅghassa vā vaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[14:25.49]86 tatra ce tumhe assatha ānandino sumanā uppilāvitā
[14:35.37]87 tumhaṁ yevassa tena antarāyo.
[14:41.88]88 Mamaṁ vā, bhikkhave, pare vaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[14:49.43]89 dhammassa vā vaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ, saṅghassa vā vaṇṇaṁ bhāseyyuṁ,
[15:00.07]90 tatra tumhehi bhūtaṁ bhūtato paṭijānitabbaṁ:
[15:08.51]91 ‘itipetaṁ bhūtaṁ, itipetaṁ tacchaṁ,
[15:15.23]92 atthi cetaṁ amhesu,
[15:19.87]93 saṁvijjati ca panetaṁ amhesū’ti.
[15:26.95]94 Appamattakaṁ kho panetaṁ, bhikkhave, oramattakaṁ sīlamattakaṁ,
[15:37.72]95 yena puthujjano tathāgatassa vaṇṇaṁ vadamāno vadeyya.
[15:47.40]96 Katamañca taṁ, bhikkhave, appamattakaṁ oramattakaṁ sīlamattakaṁ,
[15:58.23]97 yena puthujjano tathāgatassa vaṇṇaṁ vadamāno vadeyya?
[16:08.06]98 ‘Pāṇātipātaṁ pahāya pāṇātipātā paṭivirato samaṇo gotamo
[16:19.30]99 nihitadaṇḍo, nihitasattho, lajjī, dayāpanno,
[16:27.14]100 sabbapāṇabhūtahitānukampī viharatī’ti—
[16:35.17]101 iti vā hi, bhikkhave, puthujjano tathāgatassa vaṇṇaṁ vadamāno vadeyya.
[16:46.67]102 ‘Adinnādānaṁ pahāya adinnādānā paṭivirato samaṇo gotamo
[16:57.93]103 dinnādāyī dinnapāṭikaṅkhī, athenena sucibhūtena attanā viharatī’ti—
[17:10.72]104 iti vā hi, bhikkhave, puthujjano tathāgatassa vaṇṇaṁ vadamāno vadeyya.
[17:22.05]105 ‘Abrahmacariyaṁ pahāya brahmacārī samaṇo gotamo
[17:31.08]106 ārācārī virato methunā gāmadhammā’ti—
[17:39.62]107 iti vā hi, bhikkhave, puthujjano tathāgatassa vaṇṇaṁ vadamāno vadeyya.
[17:51.07]108 ‘Musāvādaṁ pahāya musāvādā paṭivirato samaṇo gotamo
[18:01.33]109 saccavādī saccasandho theto paccayiko avisaṁvādako lokassā’ti—
[18:13.68]110 iti vā hi, bhikkhave, puthujjano tathāgatassa vaṇṇaṁ vadamāno vadeyya.
[18:25.11]111 ‘Pisuṇaṁ vācaṁ pahāya pisuṇāya vācāya paṭivirato samaṇo gotamo,
[18:36.29]112 ito sutvā na amutra akkhātā imesaṁ bhedāya,
[18:44.96]113 amutra vā sutvā na imesaṁ akkhātā amūsaṁ bhedāya.
[18:54.74]114 Iti bhinnānaṁ vā sandhātā, sahitānaṁ vā anuppadātā
[19:04.88]115 samaggārāmo samaggarato samagganandī samaggakaraṇiṁ vācaṁ bhāsitā’ti—
[19:18.15]116 iti vā hi, bhikkhave, puthujjano tathāgatassa vaṇṇaṁ vadamāno vadeyya.
[19:29.54]117 ‘Pharusaṁ vācaṁ pahāya pharusāya vācāya paṭivirato samaṇo gotamo,
