[62:49.78]377 Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco samaṇo vā brāhmaṇo vā
[62:57.53]378 ātappamanvāya padhānamanvāya anuyogamanvāya appamādamanvāya sammāmanasikāramanvāya
[63:12.59]379 tathārūpaṁ cetosamādhiṁ phusati,
