[63:29.30]381 anussarati.
[63:32.67]382 Seyyathidaṁ—ekampi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭaṁ dvepi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni
[63:41.35]383 tīṇipi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni cattāripi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni
[63:50.64]384 pañcapi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni dasapi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni:
[63:59.23]385 ‘amutrāsiṁ evaṁnāmo evaṅgotto evaṁvaṇṇo evamāhāro
[64:10.34]386 evaṁsukhadukkhappaṭisaṁvedī evamāyupariyanto,
[64:18.88]387 so tato cuto amutra udapādiṁ;
[64:24.57]388 tatrāpāsiṁ evaṁnāmo evaṅgotto evaṁvaṇṇo evamāhāro
[64:36.03]389 evaṁsukhadukkhappaṭisaṁvedī evamāyupariyanto,
