[64:50.65]391 Iti sākāraṁ sauddesaṁ anekavihitaṁ pubbenivāsaṁ anussarati.
[65:01.62]392 So evamāha:
[65:05.54]393 ‘sassato attā ca loko ca vañjho kūṭaṭṭho esikaṭṭhāyiṭṭhito;
[65:16.11]394 te ca sattā sandhāvanti saṁsaranti cavanti upapajjanti,
[65:25.46]395 atthi tveva sassatisamaṁ.
[65:30.25]396 Taṁ kissa hetu?
[65:34.02]397 Ahañhi ātappamanvāya padhānamanvāya anuyogamanvāya appamādamanvāya sammāmanasikāramanvāya
[65:50.21]398 tathārūpaṁ cetosamādhiṁ phusāmi
[65:56.56]399 yathāsamāhite citte anekavihitaṁ pubbenivāsaṁ
[66:06.89]400 anussarāmi.
[66:10.27]401 Seyyathidaṁ—ekampi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭaṁ dvepi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni
[66:18.97]402 tīṇipi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni cattāripi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni
[66:28.26]403 pañcapi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni dasapi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni:
[66:36.85]404 “amutrāsiṁ evaṁnāmo evaṅgotto evaṁvaṇṇo evamāhāro
[66:47.95]405 evaṁsukhadukkhappaṭisaṁvedī evamāyupariyanto,
[66:56.50]406 so tato cuto amutra udapādiṁ;
[67:02.18]407 tatrāpāsiṁ evaṁnāmo evaṅgotto evaṁvaṇṇo evamāhāro
[67:13.64]408 evaṁsukhadukkhappaṭisaṁvedī evamāyupariyanto,
[67:22.13]409 so tato cuto idhūpapanno”ti.
[67:28.25]410 Iti sākāraṁ sauddesaṁ anekavihitaṁ pubbenivāsaṁ anussarāmi.
[67:39.48]411 Imināmahaṁ etaṁ jānāmi:
[67:45.04]412 “yathā sassato attā ca loko ca vañjho kūṭaṭṭho esikaṭṭhāyiṭṭhito,
[67:56.29]413 te ca sattā sandhāvanti saṁsaranti cavanti upapajjanti,
[68:05.48]414 atthi tveva sassatisaman”’ti.
[68:10.89]415 Idaṁ, bhikkhave, dutiyaṁ ṭhānaṁ,
[68:15.85]416 yaṁ āgamma yaṁ ārabbha eke samaṇabrāhmaṇā sassatavādā
[68:26.16]417 sassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti.
[68:33.91]418 Tatiye ca bhonto samaṇabrāhmaṇā kimāgamma kimārabbha sassatavādā
[68:44.96]419 sassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti?
[68:52.79]420 Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco samaṇo vā brāhmaṇo vā
[69:00.94]421 ātappamanvāya padhānamanvāya anuyogamanvāya appamādamanvāya sammāmanasikāramanvāya
[69:16.10]422 tathārūpaṁ cetosamādhiṁ phusati,
[69:22.38]423 yathāsamāhite citte anekavihitaṁ pubbenivāsaṁ
[69:32.65]424 anussarati.
[69:36.06]425 Seyyathidaṁ—dasapi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni vīsampi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni
[69:45.16]426 tiṁsampi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni cattālīsampi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni:
[69:55.47]427 ‘amutrāsiṁ evaṁnāmo evaṅgotto evaṁvaṇṇo evamāhāro
[70:06.60]428 evaṁsukhadukkhappaṭisaṁvedī evamāyupariyanto,
[70:14.72]429 so tato cuto amutra udapādiṁ;
[70:20.89]430 tatrāpāsiṁ evaṁnāmo evaṅgotto evaṁvaṇṇo evamāhāro
[70:32.27]431 evaṁsukhadukkhappaṭisaṁvedī evamāyupariyanto,
[70:40.70]432 so tato cuto idhūpapanno’ti.
[70:46.64]433 Iti sākāraṁ sauddesaṁ anekavihitaṁ pubbenivāsaṁ anussarati.
[70:57.36]434 So evamāha:
[71:01.25]435 ‘sassato attā ca loko ca vañjho kūṭaṭṭho esikaṭṭhāyiṭṭhito;
[71:11.80]436 te ca sattā sandhāvanti saṁsaranti cavanti upapajjanti,
[71:20.93]437 atthi tveva sassatisamaṁ.
[71:25.67]438 Taṁ kissa hetu?
[71:29.54]439 Ahañhi ātappamanvāya padhānamanvāya anuyogamanvāya appamādamanvāya sammāmanasikāramanvāya
[71:45.69]440 tathārūpaṁ cetosamādhiṁ phusāmi,
[71:52.20]441 yathāsamāhite citte anekavihitaṁ pubbenivāsaṁ
[72:02.77]442 anussarāmi.
[72:05.99]443 Seyyathidaṁ—dasapi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni vīsampi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni
[72:15.09]444 tiṁsampi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni cattālīsampi saṁvaṭṭavivaṭṭāni:
[72:25.40]445 “amutrāsiṁ evaṁnāmo evaṅgotto evaṁvaṇṇo evamāhāro
[72:36.53]446 evaṁsukhadukkhappaṭisaṁvedī evamāyupariyanto,
[72:44.65]447 so tato cuto amutra udapādiṁ;
[72:50.82]448 tatrāpāsiṁ evaṁnāmo evaṅgotto evaṁvaṇṇo evamāhāro
[73:02.20]449 evaṁsukhadukkhappaṭisaṁvedī evamāyupariyanto,
[73:10.63]450 so tato cuto idhūpapanno”ti.
[73:16.58]451 Iti sākāraṁ sauddesaṁ anekavihitaṁ pubbenivāsaṁ anussarāmi.
[73:27.65]452 Imināmahaṁ etaṁ jānāmi:
[73:33.17]453 “yathā sassato attā ca loko ca vañjho kūṭaṭṭho esikaṭṭhāyiṭṭhito,
[73:44.51]454 te ca sattā sandhāvanti saṁsaranti cavanti upapajjanti,
[73:53.65]455 atthi tveva sassatisaman”’ti.
[73:59.21]456 Idaṁ, bhikkhave, tatiyaṁ ṭhānaṁ,
[74:04.47]457 yaṁ āgamma yaṁ ārabbha eke samaṇabrāhmaṇā sassatavādā
[74:14.71]458 sassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti.
[74:22.51]459 Catutthe ca bhonto samaṇabrāhmaṇā kimāgamma kimārabbha sassatavādā
[74:33.67]460 sassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti?
[74:41.34]461 Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco samaṇo vā brāhmaṇo vā
[74:49.40]462 takkī hoti vīmaṁsī,
[74:53.97]463 so takkapariyāhataṁ vīmaṁsānucaritaṁ sayaṁ paṭibhānaṁ evamāha:
[75:04.97]464 ‘sassato attā ca loko ca vañjho kūṭaṭṭho esikaṭṭhāyiṭṭhito;
[75:15.43]465 te ca sattā sandhāvanti saṁsaranti cavanti upapajjanti,
[75:24.63]466 atthi tveva sassatisaman’ti.
[75:30.12]467 Idaṁ, bhikkhave, catutthaṁ ṭhānaṁ,
[75:35.54]468 yaṁ āgamma yaṁ ārabbha eke samaṇabrāhmaṇā sassatavādā
[75:45.86]469 sassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti.
[75:53.64]470 Imehi kho te, bhikkhave, samaṇabrāhmaṇā sassatavādā
[76:02.45]471 sassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti catūhi vatthūhi.
[76:12.23]472 Ye hi keci, bhikkhave, samaṇā vā brāhmaṇā vā sassatavādā
[76:21.75]473 sassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti,
[76:29.29]474 sabbe te imeheva catūhi vatthūhi, etesaṁ vā aññatarena;
[76:39.63]475 natthi ito bahiddhā.
[76:44.08]476 Tayidaṁ, bhikkhave, tathāgato pajānāti:
[76:50.77]477 ‘ime diṭṭhiṭṭhānā evaṅgahitā evaṁparāmaṭṭhā evaṅgatikā bhavanti
[77:03.34]478 evaṁabhisamparāyā’ti,
[77:08.63]479 tañca tathāgato pajānāti,
[77:14.00]480 tato ca uttaritaraṁ pajānāti;
[77:19.86]481 tañca pajānanaṁ na parāmasati,
[77:25.23]482 aparāmasato cassa paccattaññeva nibbuti viditā.
[77:33.34]483 Vedanānaṁ samudayañca atthaṅgamañca assādañca ādīnavañca nissaraṇañca yathābhūtaṁ viditvā
[77:48.00]484 anupādāvimutto, bhikkhave, tathāgato.
[77:54.95]485 Ime kho te, bhikkhave, dhammā gambhīrā duddasā duranubodhā
[78:04.61]486 santā paṇītā atakkāvacarā nipuṇā paṇḍitavedanīyā,
[78:14.28]487 ye tathāgato sayaṁ abhiññā sacchikatvā pavedeti,
[78:23.12]488 yehi tathāgatassa yathābhuccaṁ vaṇṇaṁ sammā vadamānā vadeyyuṁ.
[78:33.73]489 Santi, bhikkhave, eke samaṇabrāhmaṇā ekaccasassatikā
[78:46.06]490 ekaccaasassatikā ekaccaṁ sassataṁ ekaccaṁ asassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti catūhi vatthūhi.
[79:00.05]491 Te ca bhonto samaṇabrāhmaṇā kimāgamma kimārabbha ekaccasassatikā ekaccaasassatikā
[79:13.86]492 ekaccaṁ sassataṁ ekaccaṁ asassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti catūhi vatthūhi?
[79:27.82]493 Hoti kho so, bhikkhave, samayo,
[79:33.14]494 yaṁ kadāci karahaci dīghassa addhuno accayena ayaṁ loko saṁvaṭṭati.
[79:44.22]495 Saṁvaṭṭamāne loke yebhuyyena sattā ābhassarasaṁvattanikā honti.
[79:56.04]496 Te tattha honti manomayā pītibhakkhā sayaṁpabhā antalikkhacarā subhaṭṭhāyino,
[80:08.03]497 ciraṁ dīghamaddhānaṁ tiṭṭhanti.
[80:14.03]498 Hoti kho so, bhikkhave, samayo, yaṁ kadāci karahaci dīghassa addhuno accayena
[80:25.65]499 ayaṁ loko vivaṭṭati.
[80:30.33]500 Vivaṭṭamāne loke suññaṁ brahmavimānaṁ pātubhavati.
[80:39.51]501 Atha kho aññataro satto āyukkhayā vā puññakkhayā vā ābhassarakāyā cavitvā
[80:51.25]502 suññaṁ brahmavimānaṁ upapajjati.
[80:57.39]503 So tattha hoti manomayo pītibhakkho sayampabho antalikkhacaro subhaṭṭhāyī,
[81:09.07]504 ciraṁ dīghamaddhānaṁ tiṭṭhati.
[81:14.73]505 Tassa tattha ekakassa dīgharattaṁ nivusitattā anabhirati paritassanā uppajjati:
[81:26.83]506 ‘aho vata aññepi sattā itthattaṁ āgaccheyyun’ti.
[81:35.21]507 Atha aññepi sattā āyukkhayā vā puññakkhayā vā
[81:43.82]508 ābhassarakāyā cavitvā brahmavimānaṁ upapajjanti
[81:52.63]509 tassa sattassa sahabyataṁ.
[81:57.36]510 Tepi tattha honti manomayā pītibhakkhā sayaṁpabhā
[82:05.35]511 antalikkhacarā subhaṭṭhāyino, ciraṁ dīghamaddhānaṁ tiṭṭhanti.
[82:15.26]512 Tatra, bhikkhave, yo so satto paṭhamaṁ upapanno
[82:22.58]513 tassa evaṁ hoti:
[82:26.71]514 ‘ahamasmi brahmā mahābrahmā abhibhū anabhibhūto aññadatthudaso vasavattī
[82:38.50]515 issaro kattā nimmātā seṭṭho sajitā vasī pitā bhūtabhabyānaṁ.
[82:48.76]516 Mayā ime sattā nimmitā.
[82:53.67]517 Taṁ kissa hetu?
[82:57.25]518 Mamañhi pubbe etadahosi:
[83:02.66]519 “aho vata aññepi sattā itthattaṁ āgaccheyyun”ti.
[83:11.12]520 Iti mama ca manopaṇidhi,
[83:15.47]521 ime ca sattā itthattaṁ āgatā’ti.
[83:22.04]522 Yepi te sattā pacchā upapannā, tesampi evaṁ hoti:
[83:31.28]523 ‘ayaṁ kho bhavaṁ brahmā mahābrahmā abhibhū anabhibhūto aññadatthudaso vasavattī
[83:43.68]524 issaro kattā nimmātā seṭṭho sajitā vasī pitā bhūtabhabyānaṁ.
[83:54.15]525 Iminā mayaṁ bhotā brahmunā nimmitā.
[84:00.60]526 Taṁ kissa hetu?
[84:04.33]527 Imañhi mayaṁ addasāma idha paṭhamaṁ upapannaṁ,
[84:11.83]528 mayaṁ panamha pacchā upapannā’ti.
[84:18.54]529 Tatra, bhikkhave, yo so satto paṭhamaṁ upapanno,
[84:26.02]530 so dīghāyukataro ca hoti vaṇṇavantataro ca mahesakkhataro ca.
[84:36.28]531 Ye pana te sattā pacchā upapannā,
[84:42.58]532 te appāyukatarā ca honti dubbaṇṇatarā ca appesakkhatarā ca.
[84:52.51]533 Ṭhānaṁ kho panetaṁ, bhikkhave, vijjati,
[84:59.21]534 yaṁ aññataro satto tamhā kāyā cavitvā itthattaṁ āgacchati.
[85:09.77]535 Itthattaṁ āgato samāno agārasmā anagāriyaṁ pabbajati.
[85:19.82]536 Agārasmā anagāriyaṁ pabbajito samāno
[85:27.25]537 ātappamanvāya padhānamanvāya anuyogamanvāya appamādamanvāya sammāmanasikāramanvāya
[85:41.93]538 tathārūpaṁ cetosamādhiṁ phusati,
[85:48.25]539 yathāsamāhite citte taṁ pubbenivāsaṁ anussarati,
[85:57.05]540 tato paraṁ nānussarati.
[86:01.64]541 So evamāha:
[86:05.59]542 ‘yo kho so bhavaṁ brahmā mahābrahmā abhibhū anabhibhūto aññadatthudaso vasavattī
[86:18.31]543 issaro kattā nimmātā seṭṭho sajitā vasī pitā bhūtabhabyānaṁ,
[86:28.83]544 yena mayaṁ bhotā brahmunā nimmitā,
[86:35.00]545 so nicco dhuvo sassato avipariṇāmadhammo sassatisamaṁ tatheva ṭhassati.
[86:46.30]546 Ye pana mayaṁ ahumhā tena bhotā brahmunā nimmitā,
[86:54.94]547 te mayaṁ aniccā addhuvā appāyukā cavanadhammā itthattaṁ āgatā’ti.
[87:06.52]548 Idaṁ, bhikkhave, paṭhamaṁ ṭhānaṁ, yaṁ āgamma yaṁ ārabbha eke samaṇabrāhmaṇā ekaccasassatikā ekaccaasassatikā
[87:25.27]549 ekaccaṁ sassataṁ ekaccaṁ asassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti.
[87:37.00]550 Dutiye ca bhonto samaṇabrāhmaṇā kimāgamma kimārabbha ekaccasassatikā ekaccaasassatikā
[87:51.30]551 ekaccaṁ sassataṁ ekaccaṁ asassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti?
[88:02.99]552 Santi, bhikkhave, khiḍḍāpadosikā nāma devā,
[88:10.49]553 te ativelaṁ hassakhiḍḍāratidhammasamāpannā viharanti.
[88:19.51]554 Tesaṁ ativelaṁ hassakhiḍḍāratidhammasamāpannānaṁ viharataṁ sati sammussati.
[88:30.86]555 Satiyā sammosā te devā tamhā kāyā cavanti.
[88:39.32]556 Ṭhānaṁ kho panetaṁ, bhikkhave, vijjati
[88:45.79]557 yaṁ aññataro satto tamhā kāyā cavitvā itthattaṁ āgacchati.
[88:56.44]558 Itthattaṁ āgato samāno agārasmā anagāriyaṁ pabbajati.
[89:06.33]559 Agārasmā anagāriyaṁ pabbajito samāno ātappamanvāya padhānamanvāya anuyogamanvāya appamādamanvāya sammāmanasikāramanvāya
[89:28.67]560 tathārūpaṁ cetosamādhiṁ phusati,
[89:34.95]561 yathāsamāhite citte taṁ pubbenivāsaṁ anussarati,
[89:43.81]562 tato paraṁ nānussarati.
[89:48.45]563 So evamāha:
[89:52.25]564 ‘ye kho te bhonto devā na khiḍḍāpadosikā,
[89:59.68]565 te na ativelaṁ hassakhiḍḍāratidhammasamāpannā viharanti.
[90:08.96]566 Tesaṁ na ativelaṁ hassakhiḍḍāratidhammasamāpannānaṁ viharataṁ sati na sammussati.
[90:20.97]567 Satiyā asammosā te devā tamhā kāyā na cavanti;
[90:29.95]568 niccā dhuvā sassatā avipariṇāmadhammā sassatisamaṁ tatheva ṭhassanti.
[90:40.96]569 Ye pana mayaṁ ahumhā khiḍḍāpadosikā,
[90:47.54]570 te mayaṁ ativelaṁ hassakhiḍḍāratidhammasamāpannā viharimhā.
[90:57.25]571 Tesaṁ no ativelaṁ hassakhiḍḍāratidhammasamāpannānaṁ viharataṁ sati sammussati.
[91:08.78]572 Satiyā sammosā evaṁ mayaṁ tamhā kāyā cutā
[91:17.05]573 aniccā addhuvā appāyukā cavanadhammā itthattaṁ āgatā’ti.
[91:27.27]574 Idaṁ, bhikkhave, dutiyaṁ ṭhānaṁ,
[91:32.36]575 yaṁ āgamma yaṁ ārabbha eke samaṇabrāhmaṇā ekaccasassatikā ekaccaasassatikā
[91:45.92]576 ekaccaṁ sassataṁ ekaccaṁ asassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti.
[91:57.65]577 Tatiye ca bhonto samaṇabrāhmaṇā kimāgamma kimārabbha ekaccasassatikā ekaccaasassatikā
[92:11.73]578 ekaccaṁ sassataṁ ekaccaṁ asassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti?
[92:23.47]579 Santi, bhikkhave, manopadosikā nāma devā,
[92:30.78]580 te ativelaṁ aññamaññaṁ upanijjhāyanti.
[92:38.11]581 Te ativelaṁ aññamaññaṁ upanijjhāyantā aññamaññamhi cittāni padūsenti.
[92:50.07]582 Te aññamaññaṁ paduṭṭhacittā kilantakāyā kilantacittā.
[92:59.58]583 Te devā tamhā kāyā cavanti.
[93:05.59]584 Ṭhānaṁ kho panetaṁ, bhikkhave, vijjati
[93:11.92]585 yaṁ aññataro satto tamhā kāyā cavitvā itthattaṁ āgacchati.
[93:22.25]586 Itthattaṁ āgato samāno agārasmā anagāriyaṁ pabbajati.
[93:32.10]587 Agārasmā anagāriyaṁ pabbajito samāno ātappamanvāya padhānamanvāya anuyogamanvāya appamādamanvāya sammāmanasikāramanvāya
[93:54.23]588 tathārūpaṁ cetosamādhiṁ phusati,
[94:00.54]589 yathāsamāhite citte taṁ pubbenivāsaṁ anussarati,
[94:09.36]590 tato paraṁ nānussarati.
[94:13.95]591 So evamāha:
[94:17.82]592 ‘ye kho te bhonto devā na manopadosikā,
[94:25.10]593 te nātivelaṁ aññamaññaṁ upanijjhāyanti.
[94:32.72]594 Te nātivelaṁ aññamaññaṁ upanijjhāyantā aññamaññamhi cittāni nappadūsenti. Te aññamaññaṁ appaduṭṭhacittā akilantakāyā akilantacittā.
[94:50.35]595 Te devā tamhā kāyā na cavanti,
[94:56.43]596 niccā dhuvā sassatā avipariṇāmadhammā sassatisamaṁ tatheva ṭhassanti.
[95:07.55]597 Ye pana mayaṁ ahumhā manopadosikā,
[95:14.05]598 te mayaṁ ativelaṁ aññamaññaṁ upanijjhāyimhā.
[95:22.10]599 Te mayaṁ ativelaṁ aññamaññaṁ upanijjhāyantā aññamaññamhi cittāni padūsimhā,
[95:34.85]600 te mayaṁ aññamaññaṁ paduṭṭhacittā kilantakāyā kilantacittā.
[95:45.07]601 Evaṁ mayaṁ tamhā kāyā cutā aniccā addhuvā appāyukā cavanadhammā itthattaṁ āgatā’ti.
[95:59.98]602 Idaṁ, bhikkhave, tatiyaṁ ṭhānaṁ,
[96:05.04]603 yaṁ āgamma yaṁ ārabbha eke samaṇabrāhmaṇā ekaccasassatikā ekaccaasassatikā
[96:18.57]604 ekaccaṁ sassataṁ ekaccaṁ asassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti.
[96:30.21]605 Catutthe ca bhonto samaṇabrāhmaṇā kimāgamma kimārabbha ekaccasassatikā ekaccaasassatikā
[96:44.59]606 ekaccaṁ sassataṁ ekaccaṁ asassataṁ attānañca lokañca paññapenti?
[96:56.06]607 Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco samaṇo vā brāhmaṇo vā takkī hoti vīmaṁsī.
